{"id":"n68111-2-6","stage":3,"title":"오리 · 家鸭","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68111-2-6-1","ko":"내일 아들 내외가 내려온다네?","zh":"明天儿子夫妻俩要回来吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"아들","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}},{"text":"내외가","meaning":"夫妻，夫妻俩","explanation":"내외：夫妻，夫妻俩；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"내외","audio":"/audio/73eff2770d856b945b4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28547","senseId":"2","lemma":"내외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내외가","audio":"/audio/95e65e1d71b1b6515709.mp3"}},{"text":"내려온다네?","meaning":"下，回","explanation":"내려오다：下，回；ㄴ다네：向平辈或晚辈说明自己知道或听到的情况。","readings":[{"term":"내려오다","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64559","senseId":"2","lemma":"내려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려온다네","audio":"/audio/69d24cece031f7bcc682.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"73eff2770d856b94","term":"내외","zh":"夫妻，夫妻俩","audio":"/audio/73eff2770d856b945b4b.mp3","entryId":"28547","definition":"丈夫和妻子。","pronunciation":["내ː외","내ː웨"]},{"id":"35192c2853ec6a62","term":"내려오다","zh":"下，回","audio":"/audi